	quest.15C3EE8CFAB265E8.quest_desc: [
		"One thing works differently than you might expect: you won't get ingots straight from a furnace anymore. Raw ore has to be melted down and then cast – your path there runs through nuggets, obsidian, and your first Create machines."
		""
		"This questline will guide you through those first steps, all the way to holding your very first self-cast ingot. Good luck!"
		""
		"TIP: Use the JEI to look for the crafting recipes. Here is a &9glider&r to help exploring around, but always have a stack of building blocks with you!"
	]
