	quest.1BEE4E90AC4BC232.quest_desc: [
		"&lWelcome to my modpack!&r "
		""
		"You're stepping into a world built around &aCreate&r, &aMineColonies&r and &aCreate: Aeronautics&r – engineering, automation, and colony-building all come together here."
		""
		"You will encounter a different kind of world generation in this modpack, because everything you see are flying islands. This can challenge you by traveling and exploring around, but also in creating your colony! "
		""
		"I hope you have fun and enjoy this modpack!"
	]
